<title>BULGARIA: ATHLETICS-KOSTADINOVA TO MISS REST OF SEASON.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-KOSTADINOVA TO MISS REST OF SEASON.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Olympic high jump champion Stefka Kostadinova has been forced out of action for the rest of the season and will not be able to defend her world title in Athens next month.</p>
<p>Bulgarian athletics officials said on Tuesday that Kostadinova had not recovered from a bruised heel. The problem has been caused by an extra bone grown in her left leg.</p>
</text>
